### IntelliJ HTTP Client ###
# Session ids are per-developer and expire; copy http-client.private.env.json.example to
# http-client.private.env.json and paste your own. Never commit it.
http-client.private.env.json
/.codex/config.toml
/.codex/hooks.json
**/.angular/
/store-pod/landing-ui/.impeccable/*

# lcl stack runner state (.lcl/<stack>/) and its per-stack Next build dirs (.next-<stack>/)
.lcl/
**/.next-*/

# JVM crash and heap dumps. A test JVM that runs out of memory drops an .hprof next to the build, and one of
# these is hundreds of megabytes — well past GitHub's 100 MB limit, so a `git add -A` that swept one up is only
# discovered when the push is rejected.
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
